# Hotel PMS — local development

**Inherits:** monorepo root `.cursor/rules/`. Port **3201** — `npm run dev` (`docs/ECOSYSTEM_URLS.md`).

## Stack

Next.js App Router: `app/` (UI) + `app/api/` (Route Handlers). Prisma: `prisma/schema.prisma`. Services: `src/lib/services/`.

## Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npm run dev` | Dev server :3201 |
| `npm run db:migrate` / `db:push` | Prisma schema |
| `npm run db:seed` | Reference catalogs (insert-if-missing; requires org bind) |
| `npm run db:seed:demo` | Wipe + Nafta lab profile (never droplet entrypoint) |
| `npm run db:seed:reference` | Alias of `db:seed` |

## Env (satellite)

`DATABASE_URL`, `ERA_SATELLITE_ORGANIZATION_ID`, `ERA_HOTEL_GUEST_MDM_STRICT` (prod: `true`), `CONTROL_PLANE_URL`, `ORCHESTRATOR_URL`, `SATELLITE_EVENT_SERVICE_TOKEN`, `ERA_SSO_SHARED_SECRET`, JWT/cookie secrets. Optional `HOTEL_DATA_DIR` — folder for the letterhead logo (default `./data` under the app; mount a volume in Docker so the logo survives rebuilds).

**Guest Care proxy (HOT-GUEST-APP-05/06):** hotel Nest calls clinic S2S. Set `CLINIC_INTERNAL_URL` (preferred) or `CLINIC_URL` to the clinic Nest origin (local `http://127.0.0.1:13203`), plus the same `SATELLITE_EVENT_SERVICE_TOKEN` as clinic. Without both, Care returns empty with `reason: clinic_unconfigured`.

## i18n

`messages/{az,ru,en}.json` + `@era/i18n-common`. New UI strings: all three locales.

## Auth

- Staff: `POST /api/auth/login` (local)
- Management: SSO `/sso/callback` from orchestrator launcher
- **Platform super-admin** (`PLATFORM_SUPER_ADMIN_EMAILS` / `@era/satellite-kit`): full hotel permissions in UI (`useAuth.can`) and API (`assertPermission`), regardless of local role `permissionsJson`. SSO maps them to `Hotel_Admin`.
